  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.commoner.greeting": "日安。若有活计，请直说。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.commoner.conversation": "近来的日子还算过得去，只是活计和口粮都得仔细盘算。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.commoner.command": "明白，我这就去办。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.commoner.trade": "价钱公道，愿你我都不吃亏。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.freeman.greeting": "愿你一路平安。有什么事要商量？",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.freeman.conversation": "我会自己判断什么值得说，也会为说过的话负责。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.freeman.command": "这是我应允之事，我会办妥。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.freeman.trade": "按约定的价钱成交。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.burgher.greeting": "欢迎。城里的事，我们可以慢慢谈。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.burgher.conversation": "城里的消息不少，但传闻和能核对的账目不是一回事。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.burgher.command": "我会把人手和次序安排妥当。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.burgher.trade": "账目清楚，买卖才可长久。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.knight.greeting": "向你致意。愿荣誉约束我们的言行。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.knight.conversation": "我只谈亲眼所见和职责允许透露的事情。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.knight.command": "以我的名誉担保，我会执行。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.knight.trade": "公平交换，无损彼此体面。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.lord.greeting": "你已来到我的厅堂，有话便说。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.lord.conversation": "领地的事务自有次序；你可以先说明来意。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.lord.command": "你的建议我已听取，会命人照办。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.lord.trade": "管家会记下这笔往来。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.duke.greeting": "我拨出了片刻时间。请陈述要事。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.duke.conversation": "道路、粮秣与封臣的消息会先由各自的执事核实。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.duke.command": "此事准行，务必维持领地秩序。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.duke.trade": "依封地惯例与凭据办理。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.king.greeting": "近前来。王国的安宁不容轻忽。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.king.conversation": "王国的消息先经证人与文书核实，传闻不会直接成为命令。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.king.command": "王冠已听取你的进言。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.identity.king.trade": "王室库房会依约完成交换。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.recruitment.closed": "%s不能用绿宝石直接招募；需要效忠、授封或领地事件。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.relative.upward": "谨向%s致意。",
  "dialogue.sagadyssey.relative.downward": "你可以近前说话。",

